Your own projects — interviewers ask increasingly deep follow-ups.
ML system design — recommendations, ranking, fraud, forecasting and real-time prediction.
Core fundamentals — evaluation, leakage, imbalance, bias–variance and regularisation.
Coding — arrays, strings, trees, graphs, dynamic programming and Python.
Production ML — deployment, drift, monitoring, retraining and rollback.
Statistics and experimentation.
Behavioural stories showing ownership, conflict resolution, failure and impact.

